<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Subcontractor Control & Management</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Optimise your supply chain with structured subcontractor management that ensures compliance, quality, 
            and transparent financial administration.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Vetting and Prequalification</h2>
        <p>
            Build a resilient network of subcontracting partners through a structured vetting and 
            prequalification portal. Track insurance certificates, NSSA safety registrations, and commercial 
            references in a centralized vendor database. Automated alerts notify procurement teams when 
            vendor certifications are approaching expiry, ensuring that work is only awarded to compliant 
            and fully insured partners.
        </p>
        <p>
            Performance history tracking aggregates data on timely delivery, quality of work, and safety 
            compliance for every vendor across your entire project portfolio. This data-driven 
            sourcing model rewards high-performing subcontractors and identifies relationship 
            risks before they impact site operations.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Award and Progress Measurement</h2>
        <p>
            Manage the entire subcontracting lifecycle from initial tender through to final account. 
            Standardized subcontracting order templates ensure that main contract conditions and 
            safety requirements are consistently flowed down to all vendors. Digitized valuations 
            allow for the transparent measurement of subcontractor progress against the 
            originally awarded BOQ, eliminating disputes over quantities of work-in-progress.
        </p>
        <p>
            By capturing subcontractor progress as it happens on site, the system provides a 
            "real-world" view of vendor performance against the project baseline, highlighting 
            schedule risks related to specific trades.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Payment Certificates and Retention</h2>
        <p>
            Automate the complex task of calculating subcontractor payment certificates. The system 
            calculates work-to-date, current claims, and retention deductions automatically, accounting 
            for approved variation orders and previous payments. Centralized retention registers 
            track the build-up of retained capital per subcontractor and alert the finance team 
            when contractual release dates for practical and final completion are reached.
        </p>
        <p>
            Workflow-based certificate approvals ensure that site engineers and quantity surveyors 
            have verified work-in-progress before payment is authorized, protecting project 
            margins and ensuring that cash flow remains aligned with physical reality.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

